{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And be blessed in him.</b> From the nif'al binyan, and its meaning is that they will be blessed on his account, and the word והתברכו (Genesis 22:18) is not so, but rather they bless themselves by him."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:56.835419984Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}